---
source: crates/observed_macros_impl/tests/expansion.rs
expression: output
---
---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info] struct Subject { #[dimension("positional")] f: T }

---- yields ----
a positional string name is not supported; use `#[dimension(log = "...")]` to rename the log key

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Subject { #[dimension("positional")] f: T }

---- yields ----
a positional string name is not supported; use `#[dimension(log = "...")]` to rename the log key

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info] struct Subject { #[dimension = "x"] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[dimension]` does not take a `= value`; use `#[dimension]` or `#[dimension(log = ..., metric = ...)]`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Subject { #[dimension = "x"] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[dimension]` does not take a `= value`; use `#[dimension]` or `#[dimension(log = ..., metric = ...)]`

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info] struct Subject { #[dimension()] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[dimension(...)]` requires at least one of `log` or `metric`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Subject { #[dimension()] f: T }

---- yields ----
`#[dimension(...)]` requires at least one of `log` or `metric`

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info] struct Subject { #[dimension(bogus)] f: T }

---- yields ----
expected `log = "..."`, `log = exclude`, `metric`, or `metric = "..."`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Subject { #[dimension(bogus)] f: T }

---- yields ----
expected `log = "..."`, `log = exclude`, `metric`, or `metric = "..."`

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info] struct Subject { #[dimension(log = bogus)] f: T }

---- yields ----
`log` expects a string key or the `exclude` keyword

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Subject { #[dimension(log = bogus)] f: T }

---- yields ----
`log` expects a string key or the `exclude` keyword

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info] struct Subject { #[dimension(log = "a", log = "b")] f: T }

---- yields ----
duplicate `log` setting in `#[dimension(...)]`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Subject { #[dimension(log = "a", log = "b")] f: T }

---- yields ----
duplicate `log` setting in `#[dimension(...)]`

---- input ----
#[event("e")]
#[info] struct Subject { #[dimension(log = exclude, log = exclude)] f: T }

---- yields ----
duplicate `log` setting in `#[dimension(...)]`

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Subject { #[dimension(log = exclude, log = exclude)] f: T }

---- yields ----
duplicate `log` setting in `#[dimension(...)]`

---- input ----
